====== TP-Link TL-WR1041N ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The TL-WR1041N is a Low-Cost Gigabit Ethernet 2.4GHz-band dual-stream (2x2) 300Mbps wireless router.

