==== OEM easy installation ====

Install ''openwrt-ar71xx-tl-wr1041n-v2-squashfs-factory.bin'' using the "Firmware Upgrade" page of web interface of the original firmware.

  - [[:downloads|obtain]] an OpenWrt-Firmware-Image
  - [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install]]
  - [[docs:guide-quick-start:checks_and_troubleshooting|Configure]]
  - Enjoy ;-)


